fastpotify (native Spotify client with a Winamp-style interface)

Fastpotify is a fast, lightweight Spotify client written in Rust with
egui. It plays music through librespot and supports Spotify Connect.

It includes a Winamp-style mini player with skins, an equalizer, and
audio visualizers. Fastpotify uses no browser engine and runs on Linux,
macOS, and Windows.
